* The time function of the input length: from per-input step counts G n <_ exp ( C ell2 n ell3 n ) for n >= M, the function k |-> |_ exp ( C log k log log k ) _| for k >= M + 3 and the sum of G over the inputs below 2 ^ k otherwise dominates every input of length k (Lean: exists_timeFun, exists_timeFun_of_ExpB, with a sum for the finite maximum).

